      "locator": "line 4",
      "finding": "The manuscript stated only that the archived 154.114-nat total double-counted the plane and rectangle panels. The sealed Track B rows give 77.056 (plane) and 77.059 (rectangle). The review brief's 154.053-nat reading (77.056 + 76.997) is not present in any sealed authority and is explicitly withdrawn in the repaired sentence.",
      "status": "fixed"
    },
